@startuml
title POST /api/ai-agents-teams/{address}/{id}/unpublish-mail/prepare + /send — reversible deactivation
skinparam backgroundColor #F8FBFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #294C60
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF5FF
  ParticipantBorderColor #38789E
  LifeLineBorderColor #6A92AA
  GroupBackgroundColor #FFF3E8
  GroupBorderColor #D97638
}

actor "Team owner" as Owner #FFD8C2
participant "AgentsTeamsApiSdk\n.unpublishMail(id)" as SDK #D5EAF7
participant "Embers API" as API #FFC9A8
participant "AgentsTeamsService" as Domain #CDEACC
participant "F1r3node\nchain + observer" as Chain #FFE4A6

Owner -> SDK : unpublishMail(id)

group Phase 1 — prepare (no body; deploys nothing)
SDK -> API : POST .../{address}/{id}/unpublish-mail/prepare
API -> Domain : prepare deactivation
Domain -> Chain : getChannelBindingsForTeam(id) —\nfind the ACTIVE mail binding
alt no active mail binding
Domain --> API : 404 {code: binding_not_found}
else active binding found
Domain --> API : UnpublishMailResp { address, contract }\n(setChannelBindingActive false)
API --> SDK : PrepareResponse { response, token }
end
end

group Sign and send
SDK -> SDK : sign with the team owner's wallet key
SDK -> API : POST .../unpublish-mail/send\n{ prepare_request: id, echo, signed, token }
API -> Domain : deploy signed deactivation
Domain -> Chain : deploy setChannelBindingActive("mail",\naddress, false)
note right of Chain #FFF0C7
Owner-only: any other signer aborts
"binding update requires the team owner".
The record is KEPT — deactivation flips
active off, and publishing again
reactivates the same address.
end note
alt clause aborts
Chain --> Domain : deploy errored
Domain -> Chain : re-read bindings to name the cause
alt binding exists (signer was not the owner)
Domain --> API : 403 {code: binding_unauthorized}
else binding gone
Domain --> API : 404 {code: binding_not_found}
end
else clause lands
Chain --> Domain : finalized; acknowledged
Domain -> Chain : readback: the binding must be observably\ninactive before the owner is told
Domain --> API : deploy id
API --> SDK : 200 SendResp { deployId }
SDK --> Owner : address deactivated; the mail bridge's next\nrefresh drops it from RCPT (550); the DEK\nsurvives, so republishing skips provisioning
end
end
@enduml
